{
  "$comment": "Typed, atomic fields for the 26 shared archetype packs of resources/templates.md. Every catalogue template inherits its pack as a field group. `from` names the catalogue field a split or renamed field comes from; a pack field the catalogue lists must be covered by a key or a `from`. `required` is a suggested default only (§13.2). Edit here, then run `dart run tool/build_template_catalogue.dart`.",
